* xsetggr 2004-02-24  p(250342) implement 'NONE'/'KEIN' separator page
* HH 040825 FORMATTING T CHANGED;                /* HH 040825
* xsetggr 2005-02-15  no changes, restow
* XSETGGR 2007-03-22  replace call of ES...-N to direct call of module
* fhi     2007-07-12 NOM3202   C-NATERR changed, NAD23006 is obsolete.
* XSETHZ  2008-07-23 p(307577) use full name of ES-APP-SERVER-LIBRARY
* xsetggr 2010-04-07 P323994 add field NOBN-TYPE
* XSETHZ  2010-04-15 P323994 add field NOBN-TYPE-ACTIVE
* fhi     2010-09-03 NOMALL-97 Extend message line
* fhi     2011-01-11 NOMALL-936 Member name into message 1079
* xsetggr 2011-06-01 NOMALL-894 prevent NOM2103 for start separator
* XSETHZ  2011-09-13 ES-1498  STOW only for test
* xsetggr 2012-01-12 NOMALL-1020 write language independant msgs to log
* xsetggr 2012-03-11 NOMALL-1099 use interface to call RLOG from NGC
* xsetggr 2012-05-17 NOMALL-1136 improve validation of printers
* fhi     2013-08-29 FHI285    Enhance error message 406
* SU1     2014-06-04 NOMALL-1281 show last update user+date
* SU2     2014-06-23 NOMALL-1281 show last update user+date
